⚡️🇨🇭At least one dead, five injured in shooting at rave in Switzerland

One person was killed and five others injured, some seriously, in a shooting at a rave in the northern Swiss city of Aarau, police and local media reported. A major police operation is underway at the scene, with authorities urging residents to stay away from the area.

